	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(700.0, 300.0, 380.0, 150.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">*Chapter 14. Ollama must be running with phi4-mini pulled. 14A: the three Ollama widgets are chained, so each adds a column (Sentiment, Prediction, Summary); press Analyze Sentiment, then Classify Text, then Summarize Documents, waiting for each to finish. 14B: edit the prompt template and press Generate. 14C: choose the VADER method and compare with the true Tone column.*</text>
	</annotations>
